# dw-b4f: from a constructed start on B3F; its platform 2 down to B4F, where Cyrus walks off; Surf on B4F, the east wall and the ceiling (a save at rest on each), Surf on the ceiling, the waterfall's cascade down to B5F and back up to the ceiling.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BIBAREL 50 platinum:MOVE_STRENGTH platinum:MOVE_SURF platinum:MOVE_ROCK_CLIMB
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_MINE
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_FEN
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_ICICLE
set var platinum:VAR_DISTORTION_WORLD_PROGRESS 6
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_DISTORTION_WORLD_B3F 95 68 down
until idle 6000
